  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Logic : (2nd number × 2) = (3rd number + **1st number**)**\n\nGiven :\n\n(18, 39, 60)\n\n39 × 2 = 60 + 18\n\n78 = 78 (LHS = RHS)\n\n(27, 48, 69)\n\n48 × 2 = 69 + 27 \n\n96 = 96 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• **Option - (1) : (24, 64,96)**\n\n​64 × 2 = 96 + 24\n\n**128 **≠** 120 (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (35, 56, 77)\n\n​56 × 2 = 77 + 35\n\n**112 = 112 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (31, 52, 84)\n\n​52 × 2 = 84 + 31\n\n**104 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (17, 28, 49)\n\n​28 × 2 = 49 + 17\n\n**56 ≠ 66 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer. \n\nc1:T12",
